{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_12_title", "source_sha256": "409a99d78a489157bbeb8323f2d4ec0d5c62cd67a0e82058fee1a80636376b03", "ja": "それぞれのカタチ", "zh": "各自的形式", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_12_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0fd6e98b603564846f95e87a7fb974e991db8cb10b3904bc1296facd7d61501b", "ja": "落選した美希は負けてしまった事を謝るが、\n麗花と星梨花は美希がいてくれれば十分だと\n話す。夏祭りで昴が来るのを待っていた千早\nは、昴の連絡先も知らない自分に気付き自嘲\nする。そこに、可憐が偶然通り掛かる。", "zh": "落选的美希为自己的失败道歉，\n但麗花和星梨花说，只要有美希在就够了。\n在夏日祭典上等待昴到来的千早，\n意识到自己连昴的联系方式都不知道，不禁自嘲。\n就在这时，可怜恰好路过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_12_1000_003mik", "source_sha256": "87c2df2fea67acb82df282732f79cfa40557d5028974142b098acd58329dffdf", "ja": "負けちゃった。\n……ごめんなさい。", "zh": "我输了。\n……对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_12_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "3536ef92d67d011003d1c2d4e80896eda60036161f19bf08a416a687e9e5fa79", "ja": "謝らないで。美希ちゃんは、\n私のために生徒会長になろうとしたんだよね？", "zh": "别道歉。美希是为了我，才想当学生会长的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_12_1002_003mik", "source_sha256": "adb51e4a61cef1eaf09c6cab7846fcc3c994baf176e0d3993327a8f0959f7021", "ja": "うん……。\n麗花お姉さまに、喜んでほしかったから。", "zh": "嗯……因为想让丽花姐姐开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_12_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "c3f5f542601ec33457c8b10062a1ad25e85aaf084ef6ffc1c04cee78d49e31ce", "ja": "ありがとう。その気持ちだけで、とっても嬉しい。\n私は、美希ちゃんがいてくれれば十分だよ。", "zh": "谢谢你。只要有这份心意，我就非常开心了。\n对我来说，只要有美希在就足够了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_12_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "251ea2e79a8a3611c6953281af172ffd138b5134a639c13191900a80e54c572d", "ja": "私もです！", "zh": "我也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_12_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "7f7dd1b0058cc7fed9c79e3907eb3e3ad6e7013709c090c306e261b1aa5377ff", "ja": "お姉さま……星梨花……。", "zh": "姐姐……星梨花……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_12_1006_null", "source_sha256": "25d62b7e5234bdc7bc4cec74601c837fadfd911d0abe713535bf664df7602dab", "ja": "数日後、夏祭り会場……", "zh": "数日后，夏日祭典现场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_12_1007_002chi", "source_sha256": "97e5f1d29a003a5aba4b9acfcca183e0136532feb6e36800c0980c810942d943", "ja": "（私の勝手で、永吉さんを誘ってしまったけど……\n来てくれるかしら）", "zh": "（虽然自作主张邀请了永吉小姐……\n她会愿意来吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_12_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "36083602cb5a83cdca3aa639e4e2d84d4a73ab9a1fed413904aa1f253db9edbf", "ja": "そういえば私、連絡先も知らないのね。\n……本当に、姉妹とは名ばかりね。", "zh": "这么说来，我连她的联系方式都不知道呢。\n……我们真是徒有姐妹之名啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_12_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "03d64da98ff6eef933a98ecc8e2467f8eb19ded21cd5624e7016ac5e9acb3666", "ja": "……千早？", "zh": "……千早？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_12_1010_002chi", "source_sha256": "23a07eb492ed5bcd2a7f536c24aca1e94b535417b2d089c00ef7fd6f9a7e8e53", "ja": "！？　か、可憐お姉さま！？\nどうして……。", "zh": "！？可、可怜姐姐！？\n为什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_12_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "3df9fbc1075a0dbc209e86e23b339a2f3dce6d519833d602a604147a0c3c4ae3", "ja": "あなたがお祭りに来るなんて、珍しいわね。\n去年誘った時は、ちっとも乗り気じゃなかったのに。", "zh": "你居然会来参加祭典，真是少见呢。\n去年邀请你的时候，你明明一点都不感兴趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_12_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "4cefec4abef4c2e6129b63de5a06431ce2e3652c3036ff1087217becc079cdac", "ja": "す、すみません……。", "zh": "对、对不起……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_12_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "5a205445a915114d9547ce2ba668b393e4a490b4157a743816bfcbd37503b1db", "ja": "いいのよ。\n昴さんは、好きそうだものね？　お祭り。", "zh": "没关系。\n昴看起来会喜欢祭典吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_12_1014_002chi", "source_sha256": "8e7f5bac89b1be0c9c11c69c5d646b7da66155b9b538364bfa483b2c41ee1064", "ja": "は、はい。永吉さんを、誘いました。\nでも、来てくれるかどうかは、わからなくて……。", "zh": "是、是的。我邀请了永吉小姐。\n不过，她会不会来，我也不清楚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_12_1015_045kar", "source_sha256": "06ebf913cbcabb3650d073ee83f9a3096815e7ffa3bc5d9a6f3cb26aa8c59db1", "ja": "そう？\n……心配、いらないと思うけど。", "zh": "这样吗？\n……我觉得不用担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_12_1016_045kar", "source_sha256": "891eb4ecba62c8ff815880d050fafed5db598b4332299aa648cbe7cbeb1457ce", "ja": "紗代子さん達と待ち合わせをしているから、行くわ。\n……じゃあね、千早。", "zh": "因为和纱代子小姐她们约好了要碰面，我先走了。……再见，千早。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_12_1017_002chi", "source_sha256": "68d35887de7b71b6dcc42bbc5e77ff6b9e5bbe3b222d29453a7048353604e198", "ja": "は、はい。\n……。", "zh": "好、好的。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_12_1018_null", "source_sha256": "fa58af4f0361da4ef749bac0a00d6a1b0f2295a1d5c686590a1d817bd54d2cdc", "ja": "ザワザワ……", "zh": "一阵骚动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0412_story_12_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0412_story_12_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "2e518e66c77181d692ddd71292abeb5fa1c13b578a21fbe656b3c9d102a371f2", "ja": "あ、いた！　千早さん……！", "zh": "啊，找到了！千早小姐……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
